              "query": [],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "<A user specifier may have one of 3 formats: the OANDA-assigned User ID (numerical), the client-provided username prefixed by the \"@\" symbol (e.g. \"@myusername\"), or the \"@\" symbol. The \"@\" symbol on its own acts as an alias for the username of the user accessing the endpoint (as inferred from the token provided).>",
